* *"Can we schedule a 'mock hearing' or practice session where you ask me the tough questions before we go to court?"*
* *"What are the possible outcomes of this upcoming hearing, both best-case and worst-case scenarios?"*
* *"What should my demeanor and behavior be like in the courtroom?"*

